{"unit_id":"tag:03YC:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾一下，对于定义中给定的代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0001>，其基底为 <MATH_0002>，我们已经定义了小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）位点（sites）<MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004>，见《代数空间的性质》第 <REF_0001> 节。我们将默认通过包含函子（inclusion functor）<MATH_0005>（《代数空间的性质》引理 <REF_0002>）将相应的拓扑斯（topoi）视为同一个，并称之为小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑斯（topos），其所属代数空间为 <MATH_0006>。接下来，我们建立与这些位点（sites）关联的拓扑斯（topoi）之间的一些关系。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"给定对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"小平展位点及拓扑斯；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"位点类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"已定义的位点；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子","context":"用于识别拓扑斯；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"位点对应的拓扑斯；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"拓扑斯类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"识别后的拓扑斯；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
